\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Success rate vs.\ distractor count. \textbf  {Left:} semantic; \textbf  {right:} random distractors. \textbf  {Top:} \textit  {put spoon on towel}; \textbf  {bottom:} \textit  {put carrot on plate}. Dashed: baseline VLA; solid: +CGVD; colors denote architectures. Each point is the mean over 200 rollouts (20 episodes $\times $ 10 matched seeds) at counts $\{0, 4, 8, 10, 14, 18\}$ (19{,}200 episodes total); 0-distractor points are shared between panels. Numeric values with dispersion and CIs: Table\nobreakspace  {}I\hbox {}.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:scaling}{{2}{5}}
